            "code": "<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"-14 -14 544 306\" width=\"544\" height=\"306\" role=\"img\" aria-labelledby=\"dg2o4abb-t\"><title id=\"dg2o4abb-t\">Perbandingan Stack Tradisional vs Stack Edge Serverless Vour</title><rect x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"250\" height=\"278\" rx=\"6\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><text x=\"15\" y=\"29.5\" fill=\"currentColor\" font-size=\"14.5\" font-weight=\"600\">Traditional VM / VPS Stack</text><line x1=\"15\" y1=\"36\" x2=\"235\" y2=\"36\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1\" stroke-linecap=\"butt\"/><circle cx=\"18\" cy=\"57.34\" r=\"2.2\" fill=\"currentColor\"/><text x=\"28\" y=\"61.5\" fill=\"currentColor\" font-size=\"13\" opacity=\"0.88\">Sewa server $20-40/bulan sejak</text><text x=\"28\" y=\"87.5\" fill=\"currentColor\" font-size=\"13\" opacity=\"0.88\">hari pertama</text><circle cx=\"18\" cy=\"109.34\" r=\"2.2\" fill=\"currentColor\"/><text x=\"28\" y=\"113.5\" fill=\"currentColor\" font-size=\"13\" opacity=\"0.88\">Harus setup Docker, Nginx, SSL,</text><text x=\"28\" y=\"139.5\" fill=\"currentColor\" font-size=\"13\" opacity=\"0.88\">dan backup manual</text><circle cx=\"18\" cy=\"161.34\" r=\"2.2\" fill=\"currentColor\"/><text x=\"28\" y=\"165.5\" fill=\"currentColor\" font-size=\"13\" opacity=\"0.88\">Risiko downtime saat hardware fail</text><circle cx=\"18\" cy=\"187.34\" r=\"2.2\" fill=\"currentColor\"/><text x=\"28\" y=\"191.5\" fill=\"currentColor\" font-size=\"13\" opacity=\"0.88\">Skalabilitas vertikal terbatas pada</text><text x=\"28\" y=\"217.5\" fill=\"currentColor\" font-size=\"13\" opacity=\"0.88\">spek server</text><rect x=\"266\" y=\"0\" width=\"250\" height=\"278\" rx=\"6\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><text x=\"281\" y=\"29.5\" fill=\"currentColor\" font-size=\"14.5\" font-weight=\"600\">Vour Edge Serverless Stack</text><line x1=\"281\" y1=\"36\" x2=\"501\" y2=\"36\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1\" stroke-linecap=\"butt\"/><circle cx=\"284\" cy=\"57.34\" r=\"2.2\" fill=\"currentColor\"/><text x=\"294\" y=\"61.5\" fill=\"currentColor\" font-size=\"13\" opacity=\"0.88\">Biaya $0 saat traffic sepi, &lt;$10 saat</text><text x=\"294\" y=\"87.5\" fill=\"currentColor\" font-size=\"13\" opacity=\"0.88\">mulai jalan</text><circle cx=\"284\" cy=\"109.34\" r=\"2.2\" fill=\"currentColor\"/><text x=\"294\" y=\"113.5\" fill=\"currentColor\" font-size=\"13\" opacity=\"0.88\">Deploy otomatis via Git push tanpa</text><text x=\"294\" y=\"139.5\" fill=\"currentColor\" font-size=\"13\" opacity=\"0.88\">pusing OS</text><circle cx=\"284\" cy=\"161.34\" r=\"2.2\" fill=\"currentColor\"/><text x=\"294\" y=\"165.5\" fill=\"currentColor\" font-size=\"13\" opacity=\"0.88\">Multi-region redundancy bawaan</text><text x=\"294\" y=\"191.5\" fill=\"currentColor\" font-size=\"13\" opacity=\"0.88\">penyedia cloud</text><circle cx=\"284\" cy=\"213.34\" r=\"2.2\" fill=\"currentColor\"/><text x=\"294\" y=\"217.5\" fill=\"currentColor\" font-size=\"13\" opacity=\"0.88\">Auto-scale dari 0 ke ribuan request</text><text x=\"294\" y=\"243.5\" fill=\"currentColor\" font-size=\"13\" opacity=\"0.88\">secara instan</text></svg>",
            "type": "svg",
            "caption": "Perbandingan Stack Tradisional vs Stack Edge Serverless Vour",
